Ramanujan’s number is
\[
z=\frac{32-8i}{5+3i}
=\frac{(32-8i)(5-3i)}{(5+3i)(5-3i)}
=\frac{136-136i}{34}
=4-4i.
\]
Indeed, \((4-4i)(5+3i)=32-8i\). Thus option **(G)** is correct. Response B incorrectly simplifies \(\frac{136-136i}{34}\) as \(4-i\), so its final answer is wrong.

